Define $\bar h: A / \theta \to \Img h$ by $\map {\bar h} {\eqclass a \theta} = \map h a$.
$\bar h$ is well-defined and [[Definition:Injection|injective]] by definition of $\theta$, [[Definition:Surjection|surjective]] onto $\Img h$, and a homomorphism as the operations are defined on representatives.
{{qed}}
